          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The client holds all the keys. It serializes its whole local store, gzips it, encrypts it with AES-256-GCM under a key the server has never seen, and pushes the result as one opaque blob. The server stores bytes, versions them, and refuses writes that would clobber another device's. It also stores two small "
